{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-c8feda2006c4","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-c8feda2006c4","name":"巴基斯坦牛肉咖喱","category":"meat_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/meat_dish/%E5%B7%B4%E5%9F%BA%E6%96%AF%E5%9D%A6%E7%89%9B%E8%82%89%E5%92%96%E5%96%B1/%E5%B7%B4%E5%9F%BA%E6%96%AF%E5%9D%A6%E7%89%9B%E8%82%89%E5%92%96%E5%96%B1.md","blob_sha":"bb8946ab4c0612c3179adf32dd5ee47276962a92","details":{"introduction":"这道巴基斯坦风味咖喱牛肉香浓软糯，酸辣开胃，带着浓郁的香料气息。牛肉提供优质蛋白，搭配番茄和酸奶，营养均衡。做法不算繁琐，但慢炖需要一点耐心，很适合在闲暇的周末从容准备。从头到尾大约两个半小时，就能端出一锅温暖的异国美味。","difficulty":"★★★★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 普通的炒锅\n- 电饭煲/电炖锅\n- Masala 粉（品牌可选 Shan）\n- 牛肉\n- 番茄\n- 螺丝椒\n- 原味酸奶\n- 蒜粉\n- 姜粉"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"这里以 1kg 牛肉的所需要的配菜量作为标的，可以通过它计算出不同菜量。1kg 牛肉做出的咖喱大概够 5 个人吃。\n\n1kg 牛肉所需要的配菜量：\n\n- 番茄🍅 4 个\n- 螺丝椒 2 个（大个的）\n- 原味酸奶 1 盒\n- Masala 粉一包 50g\n- 蒜粉 5g\n- 姜粉 5g"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 全部螺丝椒切成段状，备用\n2. 全部番茄打成番茄蓉，备用\n\n3. 牛肉切成 2cm 的小块，洗净备用\n\n4. 炒锅中倒入一层油（用来防止番茄蓉沸腾蒸发）\n\n5. 倒入番茄蓉，持续搅拌 2-3 分钟，等待它越变越红\n\n\n6. 加入 5g 蒜粉，5g 姜粉和 1 包 50g 的 Masala 粉，搅拌均匀\n7. 加入牛肉和螺丝椒段，搅拌均匀\n8. 加入 1 盒酸奶（为了让整个酱汁变得粘稠），搅拌均匀\n9. 将整锅材料转移到电饭煲/电炖锅，并加入 250 ml 的水，开启炖肉/慢炖档，设定时间 2-3 个小时\n10. 等待完成，开锅检查牛肉软糯，就可以吃了"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"这道菜是从一个巴基斯坦的朋友那里偷师而来，特地整理了笔记，绝对正宗。\n\n通常配以 烙饼(roti)、馕(naan) 或 米饭 食用。\n\n如果想做 Chicken karahi 流程几乎是一样的，除了是先用油和各种花椒胡椒煎鸡肉变黄。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：牛胸腹肉（去骨带脂）400g、红熟番茄500g、青甜椒150g、原味全脂酸奶150g、蒜粉5g、姜15g、孜然籽8g、芫荽籽粉8g、姜黄粉4g、甜椒粉6g、小豆蔻2g、肉桂粉1g、食盐3g、大豆食用油20g、饮用水250g；整份约1050g。自配明确香料替代Shan/Masala商业混合粉，鲜姜替代姜粉；限定牛胸腩，全部番茄酸奶和汤汁食用，不等于品牌Masala配方。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":144.83619,"protein_g":8.524105,"carbohydrate_g":5.522,"fat_g":10.184514},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/168664/nutrients","version":"edf663c4c1f8c7be","fdc_ids":[168664,170457,170427,171284,171325,169231,170923,170922,172231,171329,170919,171320,173468,171411,173647]},"profile_id":"family-c8feda2006c4-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-c8feda2006c4","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-c8feda2006c4","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"braise","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-c8feda2006c4-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"beef_brisket","grams":400},{"key":"tomato","grams":500},{"key":"pepper_green","grams":150},{"key":"yogurt","grams":150},{"key":"garlic_powder","grams":5},{"key":"ginger","grams":15},{"key":"cumin","grams":8},{"key":"coriander_seed","grams":8},{"key":"turmeric","grams":4},{"key":"paprika","grams":6},{"key":"cardamom","grams":2},{"key":"cinnamon","grams":1},{"key":"salt","grams":3},{"key":"oil","grams":20},{"key":"water","grams":250}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"edf663c4c1f8c7be","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-c8feda2006c4-v1.1f480fe03ff1bc40.json","bytes":58794,"sha256":"1f480fe03ff1bc40c5fec5463323c99cc076392e3721fad28454ebd32f627e9b"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-c8feda2006c4-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-c8feda2006c4","recipe_blob_sha":"bb8946ab4c0612c3179adf32dd5ee47276962a92","version":"1","data_version":"edf663c4c1f8c7be","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":1050,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品1050g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_co